        text: "A dragon horse gains a +2 bonus on damage rolls if it charges while flying. Plane Shift (Sp) A dragon horse can enter the Ethereal Plane, Astral Plane, Elemental Plane of Air, or the Material Plane. This ability transports the dragon horse and up to two other creatures, provided they are on its back."
