        type: "Su",
        text: "All creatures within a 30-feet radius that see a bog mummy must make a DC 16 Will save or be paralyzed with fear for 1d4 rounds. Whether or not the save is successful, that creature cannot be affected again by the same bog mummy's despair ability for one day. This is a paralysis and a mind-affecting fear effect. The save DC is Charisma-based. Marsh Move (Ex) Bog mummies can move at their normal movement speed through mud, marshes, and swamps with no penalty.",
