        text: "A creature that successfully saves cannot be affected again by her fear aura for one day. Other devils are immune to the aura. The save DC is Charisma-based. Amaheuris: Lilith carries a unique +2 axiomatic unholy longsword. Once per day, she can fire a finger of death (caster level 15th) from her weapon at a single target she can see and that is within 50 feet. A target struck must succeed on a DC 20 Fortitude save or die. Even if the save succeeds, the target takes 3d6+10 points of damage."
