      "burning blood": {
        type: "Su",
        text: "When a burning ghat takes damage from a slashing or piercing weapon, its flesh bursts open and sprays the attacker with a mixture of burning fluids. The attacker must succeed on a DC 14 Reflex save or take 1d6 points of fire damage. The save DC is Charisma-based."
      },
