        text: "Three times per day, as a standard action, a demonic mist can attempt to crush the mind of a single creature within 40 feet. The target must make a DC 15 Will save or take 3d6 points of damage and become sickened for 1d4+1 rounds. This is a mind-affecting effect. The save DC is Charisma-based. Vulnerability to Wind (Ex) A demonic mist is treated as a Tiny creature for the purposes of determining the effects high wind has upon it."
