        type: "Ex",
        text: "An edon is deaf and automatically fails any Perception check based on sound. It is immune to any effect that requires the target be able to hear. Stench Aura (Ex) An edon's stench aura affects only humans and halflings, and creatures with the scent special ability. All other creatures are immune to its effects. An edon can suppress its stench for 1d2 hours by rubbing juniper berries on its body. Doing so negates the aura for the duration."
