    reach: "15 ft.",
    environment: "any (Plane of Air)",
    visualDescription: "This enormous cloud-like creature has no discernible features as it spins into cyclone form.",
    description: "Susir makes his home hidden among the fog and clouds of the Plane of Air. His great airy palace is formed of the same material as the Plane itself and swirls and shifts across the great expanse of the Plane of Air. Within his palace dwell air elementals of all sizes and ages, invisible stalkers, will-o-wisps, and an array of other air-based creatures. Susir dislikes combat, believing it a boring and mundane activity. If forced into battle however, he attacks first using his chain lighting attacks, followed by his whirlwind.",
    organization: "solitary or band (Susir plus 2-4 greater air elementals)",
    languages: "Aquan, Auran, Common, Ignan, Terran; telepathy 100 ft.",
